his simple stewed rhubarb for us and we would eat it warm in a little bowl alongside dinner. It was like getting to eat dessert before dinner! It does take some sugar to make this plant taste really wonderful but it&#39;s so packed with nutrients it makes it one of the healthiest things you can add to any dish where you might use fruit.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Rhubarb is definitely a vegetable that has chameleon&nbsp;like qualities that allow it to blend beautifully with strawberries and mimic fruit in pies, muffins and pastries.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jgtipugr":{"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.PaginatedGridGallery","language":"en","compId":"comp-jgtipugr","mainPageId":"qgy49","trackClicksAnalytics":false,"skin":"PaginatedGridArrowsOutside","rows":3,"columns":3,"items":[{"image":{"width":1500,"height":1125,"uri":"577c92_a6030c3666ae40b1949b177ab9ee1bd0~mv2.jpg","title":"Victoria Rhubarb Flowers","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true},"dataId":"dataItem-jgtirpvk","id":"dataItem-jgtirpvk","title":"Victoria Rhubarb Flowers","description":"These gorgeous blooms must be cut to keep the plant from going to seed."},{"image":{"width":1500,"height":1125,"uri":"577c92_758c660a83f64fa6bd5b2a5834768c6f~mv2.jpg","title":"Victoria Rhubarb Flowers","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgE