ss=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The leaves of the rhubarb are poisonous and should never be eaten.</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">When harvesting the stalks, pull them from the crown with a gentle twisting motion or cut them with shears as close to the ground as possible. Then nip off the leaves for the compost pile. You will be left with beautiful shiny green stems tinged with crimson and the aroma of them&nbsp;is incredible.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-jgtisv4z":{"alt":"Victoria Rhubarb Sauce Recipe","width":1500,"height":1125,"uri":"577c92_a6030c3666ae40b1949b177ab9ee1bd0~mv2.jpg","containerId":"comp-jgtisv4z","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true,"responsiveImageProps":{"fallbackSrc":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_a6030c3666ae40b1949b177ab9ee1bd0~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_566,h_425,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/577c92_a6030c3666ae40b1949b177ab9ee1bd0~mv2.jpg","srcset":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/577c92_a6030c3666ae40b1949b177ab9ee1bd0~mv2.jpg